@startuml D-Fence-Crew
' Lab 2/3 v0.3. Role view 3 of 4 — Cleaning Crew. Subset of use-case-diagram.puml, same IDs.
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Registered User\n{abstract}" as RU
actor "Cleaning Crew Member" as CCM
actor "Telegram Service" as TG

CCM --|> RU

rectangle "D-Fence — Field Work" {
  usecase "1.2 Sign In" as UC12
  usecase "6.4 View Assigned Jobs" as UC64
  usecase "6.5 Accept and Start Job" as UC65
  usecase "6.6 Complete Job with Evidence" as UC66
  usecase "6.7 Raise Issue on Job" as UC67
  usecase "4.4 Notify Crew Member" as UC44
}

RU  -- UC12
CCM -- UC64
CCM -- UC65
CCM -- UC66
CCM -- UC67
UC44 -- CCM
UC44 -- TG

note bottom of UC67
  Direct association: 8.3.8 permits
  raising an issue at any point
  before completion (Assigned,
  Accepted, or In Progress).
end note
@enduml
